{"id":"o-clearspacetheatre-org","claimKey":"005d191debbf519ac30b6b7b91b4600f85cdf99204579c823cd313f753f5b6e6","title":"Clear Space Theatre Company","cat":"play","art":"theatre","area":"Philadelphia, DE","metroId":"","src":"clearspacetheatre.org","specs":[],"options":[{"name":"Buy Tickets","detail":"","price":null},{"name":"Summer Camps","detail":"","price":null}],"services":[{"name":"Buy Tickets","desc":null,"photo":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66f46f90bd616350bf1d2e5e/3412a3ec-d907-44cd-a8ea-f86d8ec58e45/8.16%2BCelebration%2BMall_0.jpg?format=2500w","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":0}]},{"name":"Summer Camps","desc":"Clear Space’s summer camps began in 2004 to serve students of Sussex County, Delaware. Since then, thousands of students have participated, many from well beyond Sussex County. Each year, camps reach capacity early, so it’s important to reserve your child’s spot quickly. Each camp is designed to give students a glimpse into the process for creating a professional production. Mirroring some of the rehearsal and production process of Clear Space’s own summer repertory season, students will create and perform a short live production by the end of each week. Five camps will be offered in Rehoboth Beach, with two additional camps to be announced later this winter at other locations. Our Rehoboth","photo":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66f46f90bd616350bf1d2e5e/404c070c-04ff-4725-8fd4-7d61887a27a5/IMG_8609.JPG?format=2500w","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":1}]}],"includes":[],"addons":[],"gap":"Prices, hours and eligibility are not copied here yet. We will ask when you request.","blurb":"Clear Space is the most prolific producer of professional theater in the state of Delaware.","cover":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66f46f90bd616350bf1d2e5e/360241f1-8e55-4df5-982b-a2a56e726156/2027+Season+Announcement+Party+Dogfish.png?format=2500w","photos":["https://images.squ